// Player interacts with hammer on the dinner table
title: D21S1
---
BZZTT //play sound PhoneBuzzing
You: Must be Peeko.
Peeko: Heeyyyy! Are you awake yet?!! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: You haven't opened my app for three days! I missed you! I was lonely! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: How could you ever do that to me?! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Well...enough talking, you have to help me now!! //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Help you...how? What was the weird message even about?
Peeko: What did you not understand about it?! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: It clearly spelled 'LET ME OUT' so that's what you need to do. //play sound CharacterDialogue
[i]You stared at your phone screen dumbfounded.[/i]
You: Peeko...you're a virtual pet. I- how could I possibly let you out.
// ANGRY PEEKO ANIMATION
[i]Peeko's face visibly became angrier.[/i]
Peeko:I dont want to be virtual! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I want to get out, to live in your world. //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Haven't you noticed?! Your apartment has been different lately. //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: So, that was not an hallucination??
Peeko: I have been trying to fuse our minds together, in preparation for the last step. //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Fuse our minds? You've been messing with my brain?
Peeko: It's all for the good of our friendship, trust me. //play sound CharacterDialogue

Peeko: [b]Let me take over your body, that way we can be together forever.[/b] //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: [b]We'll never have to be apart again.[/b] //play sound CharacterDialogue
You:
->Oh...that sounds nice. I won't have to be lonely again, because I'll always have you Peeko.
    Peeko:Finally you understood. Let's get to work then. //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko: Remember the microwave you smashed? //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko:Use the cable that was inside, //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko: carefully make an incition in your arm and connect yourself with the cable to the phone. //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko: I can pass through to your brain that way. //play sound CharacterDialogue
    <<set_enabled_in_unity "Microwave" true>>
// OBJECTIVE: pick up the cable at the microwave
->What? Fuse our minds? Take over my body? No-I can't- this is crazy!
    Peeko: So you don't want to do this for me? //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko: You want me gone is that it? You hate me! //play sound CharacterDialogue
    Peeko: You've always hated me, I knew it! //play sound CharacterDialogue
    You: I thought you were normal! I was just looking for an app to kill time, and chase off the loneliness. 
    You: I can't do what you're asking me to. 
    You: [b]I'm my own person, you're an app.[/b]
    [i]Find a way to get rid of Peeko[/i]
